{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02675","headline":"结客少年场行 · 孔绍安","name":"结客少年场行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"结客佩吴钩，横行度陇头。\n鴈在弓前落，云从阵後浮。\n吴师惊燧象，燕将警奔牛。\n转蓬飞不息，冰河结未流。\n若使三边定，当封万户侯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孔绍安","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02675.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02675","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}